    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u275dRevenge and Correcting Old Sins Come Together in One Entity\u275e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revenge Crystal </strong>is an epic top-down action RPG. Awaken as a knight with no memory in a ruined land overrun by mysterious invaders. Battle fierce foes, solve intricate puzzles, and navigate interconnected challenges to reclaim hope. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/20b087dadb0385d3aadb29ffefdc3077.poster.avif?t=1747557472\" width=544 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/20b087dadb0385d3aadb29ffefdc3077.webm?t=1747557472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/20b087dadb0385d3aadb29ffefdc3077.mp4?t=1747557472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a rich, diverse world, bursting with secrets and dangers in every unique environment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic battles with fierce enemies and powerful bosses, testing your combat skills to the max. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield magical spells with the option to enhance them with elemental powers for devastating effects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own journey, making choices that determine your path and the challenges you face. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character to suit your playstyle, evolving skills and abilities to conquer your foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/bf2b3f09f38a8e5f4d4704db78bf1157.poster.avif?t=1747557472\" width=544 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/bf2b3f09f38a8e5f4d4704db78bf1157.webm?t=1747557472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/bf2b3f09f38a8e5f4d4704db78bf1157.mp4?t=1747557472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a darkened cell, an unknown knight wakes up after a long sleep, on a strange call commands him to end this nightmare. He has no memory of his past, and his body is affected by strange crystals. He starts his journey in a destroyed world under control of unknown invaders. He attempts to find out who he is and why he feels the need for revenge. During his journey filled with challenges and enemies everywhere, he will be forced to face his past secrets and the sins of his people, known as the &quot;Crystallne&quot;, who caused the destruction of several worlds.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/c20aa4d3b0abb5b2a62a94eceacef86e.poster.avif?t=1747557472\" width=544 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/c20aa4d3b0abb5b2a62a94eceacef86e.webm?t=1747557472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/c20aa4d3b0abb5b2a62a94eceacef86e.mp4?t=1747557472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u275dRevenge and Correcting Old Sins Come Together in One Entity\u275e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revenge Crystal </strong>is an epic top-down action RPG. Awaken as a knight with no memory in a ruined land overrun by mysterious invaders. Battle fierce foes, solve intricate puzzles, and navigate interconnected challenges to reclaim hope. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/20b087dadb0385d3aadb29ffefdc3077.poster.avif?t=1747557472\" width=544 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/20b087dadb0385d3aadb29ffefdc3077.webm?t=1747557472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/20b087dadb0385d3aadb29ffefdc3077.mp4?t=1747557472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a rich, diverse world, bursting with secrets and dangers in every unique environment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic battles with fierce enemies and powerful bosses, testing your combat skills to the max. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield magical spells with the option to enhance them with elemental powers for devastating effects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own journey, making choices that determine your path and the challenges you face. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character to suit your playstyle, evolving skills and abilities to conquer your foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/bf2b3f09f38a8e5f4d4704db78bf1157.poster.avif?t=1747557472\" width=544 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/bf2b3f09f38a8e5f4d4704db78bf1157.webm?t=1747557472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/bf2b3f09f38a8e5f4d4704db78bf1157.mp4?t=1747557472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a darkened cell, an unknown knight wakes up after a long sleep, on a strange call commands him to end this nightmare. He has no memory of his past, and his body is affected by strange crystals. He starts his journey in a destroyed world under control of unknown invaders. He attempts to find out who he is and why he feels the need for revenge. During his journey filled with challenges and enemies everywhere, he will be forced to face his past secrets and the sins of his people, known as the &quot;Crystallne&quot;, who caused the destruction of several worlds.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/c20aa4d3b0abb5b2a62a94eceacef86e.poster.avif?t=1747557472\" width=544 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/c20aa4d3b0abb5b2a62a94eceacef86e.webm?t=1747557472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713680/extras/c20aa4d3b0abb5b2a62a94eceacef86e.mp4?t=1747557472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
